{"id": "tech-5", "headline": "Megaspeed headed for US export blacklist", "source": "TechCrunch", "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/megaspeed-the-company-at-the-center-of-the-jensen-huang-scandal-appears-headed-for-a-u-s-blacklist/", "published": "2026-11-23", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Megaspeed, the Singapore-based cloud and AI infrastructure company tied to the Nvidia scandal, will be added to the US Commerce Department Entity List, Semafor reported Monday. The listing means US companies need a special license to sell to it. Sources told Semafor the move is meant to stop Megaspeed from obtaining US-made semiconductors. Megaspeed was one of Nvidia's biggest chip customers and was led for more than two years by Alice Huang, the woman at the center of the alleged espionage case. Last week Commerce opened a criminal probe, and US and Singaporean authorities are examining whether it illegally sent Nvidia chips to China. The company denies wrongdoing. Source: TechCrunch."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110100001101110000001001110101111111", "10000010110110000100101010001010001000001", "10111010011001010111010111000101101011101", "10111010000101100101111001110111101011101", "10111010101000100110011011100010001011101", "10000010101010100100110010000110001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000101000101011101100101000000000000", "11100110111100000000100110111000111110011", "11110000100110111101011111110001101101001", "01100010110110110101011101011111010011101", "01110101111010100010100110011011001101010", "10011010010010011001100100111001101100000", "00011100011000011101100110011001101101111", "01100110100111011001111111111011011010001", "01011101010000010011100100111010111111000", "11101111110100011001100110100000101101001", "00111100000111011001100111010101101100001", "10100010100110110111110101011001101111111", "10011000010110101010001010110001110101001", "11000011110010001010100100011000101100011", "010000011100010111011001110111